GmailDock is an independent, unofficial desktop wrapper for Gmail.

Gmail and Google are trademarks of Google LLC. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Google. The application icon
adapts Google's Gmail artwork to identify the wrapped service, following
Google's guidance for internal communications. Replace the icon in
`src-tauri/icons` if you redistribute this project under different branding.

Tauri, WebView2, WebKitGTK, and the other dependencies are covered by their
own licenses. See `src-tauri/Cargo.lock` and `package-lock.json` for the
exact versions.
